+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id for password hashing (and key derivation). It was chosen because its memory-hard, CPU-intensive design makes GPU-accelerated brute-force attacks significantly more expensive. No specific argon2id parameters (memory, iterations, parallelism) are recorded.
